OL,3,GNEWSA'If it was a kitten or a dog
OL,4,Apeople would immediately jump to
OL,5,Aaction'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn the steps of Castle Square sits a
OL,8,Fwoman dubbed Sheffield's pigeon lady.
OL,10,FVicky Prest volunteers for Sheffield
OL,11,FStringfoot Pigeons and Bird Rescue, and
OL,12,Fdevotes a huge part of her life to
OL,13,Fhelping injured birds.
OL,15,FThe group operates through Facebook and
OL,16,Fcan receive up to 10 callouts an hour.
OL,18,FIf someone were to find an injured bird
OL,19,Fin Sheffield, they could post the
OL,20,Flocation in the Facebook group, and be
OL,21,Fmet by Vicky, or another volunteer,
OL,22,Fequipped with supplies to rescue it.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
